## State Machine

```
Start
  ↓
Locate the current DEVSOP task directory (based on git branch + traversing the Meta `branch` field of .docs/plans/*/00-overview.md)
  ↓
  ├── Task directory not found → prompt the user to establish a task directory per the DEVSOP first, terminate the flow
  └── Found .docs/plans/<task dir>/01-clarify.md
        ↓
Check the current state of 01-clarify.md
  ├── Not exist / template placeholder → new mode (overwrite write)
  └── Already has valid content → ask: full rewrite / partial supplement / read-only reference
        ├── Full rewrite → overwrite write
        ├── Partial supplement → append a "## Supplementary Clarification - YYYY-MM-DD" section
        └── Read-only reference → do not write the file
  ↓
User states the idea
  ↓
Phase One Discovery (multiple rounds, each round: empathize → guess → follow up)
  ↓
AI judges clarity is sufficient → ask: enter the challenge phase or quickly output the document?
  ↓
┌── Quick mode ──────────────────────────────→ output → save to disk per the write strategy
│
└── Standard mode
       ↓
    Phase Two Challenge (challenge core assumptions one by one, usually 3-5)
       ↓
    User wavers → return to Phase One (partial re-sorting) → enter Phase Two again
       ↓
    User confirms / exits early
       ↓
    Output → save to disk in 01-clarify.md per the write strategy → summary confirmation → remind to return to the main DEVSOP flow
```
